  "slug": "s-mores-apple-candy-salad-recipe-12009843",
  "name": "S\u2019Mores Apple Candy Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This S\u2019Mores Apple Candy Salad, easy to make in a jar with a lid, is a shake-and-go, no cook apple and yogurt salad with the elements of a S\u2019More. It\u2019s a yummy snack or dessert or whenever-you-crave-it kind of dish.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine apple, graham cracker pieces, yogurt, mini marshmallows, vanilla bean paste, and mini chocolate chips in a jar with a lid, or a bowl."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Close the jar with a lid, or cover the bowl tightly. Shake or stir until everything is evenly coated. Serve and enjoy!"
    }
  ],
